        <mxCell id="IWq4VaEdpI8EjAQgPOS--23" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(18, 18, 18)); color: light-dark(rgb(31, 35, 40), rgb(205, 208, 212)); font-family: &amp;quot;Mona Sans VF&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans Backtick Fix&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;1. Liste os vértices adjacentes a cada vértice:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1f2328&quot; face=&quot;Mona Sans VF, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Noto Sans Backtick Fix, Noto Sans, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Vértice 1:&amp;nbsp; 2,4 e 5&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1f2328&quot; face=&quot;Mona Sans VF, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Noto Sans Backtick Fix, Noto Sans, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Vértice 2: 1 e 3&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1f2328&quot; face=&quot;Mona Sans VF, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Noto Sans Backtick Fix, Noto Sans, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Vértice 3: 2 e 4&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1f2328&quot; face=&quot;Mona Sans VF, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Noto Sans Backtick Fix, Noto Sans, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Vértice 4: 1 e 3 ( possui laço)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1f2328&quot; face=&quot;Mona Sans VF, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Noto Sans Backtick Fix, Noto Sans, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Vértice 5: 1&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1f2328&quot; face=&quot;Mona Sans VF, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Noto Sans Backtick Fix, Noto Sans, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(18, 18, 18)); color: light-dark(rgb(31, 35, 40), rgb(205, 208, 212)); font-family: &amp;quot;Mona Sans VF&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans Backtick Fix&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;2. Informe quais arestas são incidentes em cada vértice:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Mona Sans VF, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Noto Sans Backtick Fix, Noto Sans, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Vértice 1:&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;(1,2), (1,4), (1,5)&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Mona Sans VF, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Noto Sans Backtick Fix, Noto Sans, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Vértice 2:&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;(1,2), &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;(2,3)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Mona Sans VF, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Noto Sans Backtick Fix, Noto Sans, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Vértice 3:&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;(2,3), &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;(3,4)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Mona Sans VF, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Noto Sans Backtick Fix, Noto Sans, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Vértice 4:&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;(1,4), &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;(3,4), &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;(4,4)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Mona Sans VF, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Noto Sans Backtick Fix, Noto Sans, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Vértice 5:&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;(1,5)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1f2328&quot; face=&quot;Mona Sans VF, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Noto Sans Backtick Fix, Noto Sans, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(18, 18, 18)); color: light-dark(rgb(31, 35, 40), rgb(205, 208, 212)); font-family: &amp;quot;Mona Sans VF&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans Backtick Fix&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;3. Escolha dois vértices adjacentes e explique por que são considerados vizinhos:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1f2328&quot; face=&quot;Mona Sans VF, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Noto Sans Backtick Fix, Noto Sans, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- (1,2) e (3,4)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1f2328&quot; face=&quot;Mona Sans VF, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Noto Sans Backtick Fix, Noto Sans, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Vértices adjacentes são considerados vizinhos pois tem uma aresta ligando diretamente os dois.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(18, 18, 18)); color: light-dark(rgb(31, 35, 40), rgb(205, 208, 212)); font-family: &amp;quot;Mona Sans VF&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans Backtick Fix&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;4. Escolha dois vértices não adjacentes e justifique sua resposta.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(18, 18, 18)); color: light-dark(rgb(31, 35, 40), rgb(205, 208, 212)); font-family: &amp;quot;Mona Sans VF&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans Backtick Fix&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- (1,3) e (2,4)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(18, 18, 18)); color: light-dark(rgb(31, 35, 40), rgb(205, 208, 212)); font-family: &amp;quot;Mona Sans VF&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans Backtick Fix&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Vértices não adjacentes são aquele que não são ligados por uma mesma aresta.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
